# Reviewed architecture obligations, not a certified CSfC capability package.
AVAILABLE: node:red must reach node:black for https.
INNER: node:red must traverse group:inner before node:black for https.
OUTER: node:red must traverse group:outer before node:black for https.
NO_REVERSE: node:black must be isolated from node:red for https.
NO_SSH: node:red must be isolated from node:black for ssh.
